6.steps:
1. Add a static route, src X0 subnet, dst to 40.1.1.0/24, outgoing interface X1;
2. Add a static route, src X3 subnet, dst to 80.1.1.0/24, outgoing interface X2;
3. Send traffic from X0 subnet to 40.1.1.0/24 and check the traffic flow;
4. Send traffic from X3 subnet to 80.1.1.0/24 and check the traffic flow;

8.steps:
1. Configure interface X2, zone WAN , connected to a router;
2. Add a static route, dst to 60.1.1.0/24, outgoing interface X2, gateway: router IP;
3. Send traffic to 60.1.1.0/24 from X0 subnet, check the traffic flow;

5.steps:
1. Configure interface X2, zone DMZ, static IP;
2. Connect PC to X2;
3. Add static route on FW, src: X2 subnet, dst: 40.1.1.0/24, outgoing interface X3;
4. Send traffic from X2 subnet to 40.1.1.0/24 and check the traffic flow.
